{"hymn":"S171","parent":"E215","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Percibimos Tu presencia","subtitle":"Alabanza al Señor—En memoria de Él","syl":{"n1":["Per","i"],"n2":["ci","m"],"n3":["bi","m"],"n4":["mos","t"],"n5":"Tu","n6":["pre","i"],"n7":["sen","m"],"n8":["cia","t"],"n9":"En","n10":"Tu","n11":["me","i"],"n12":["sa,","t"],"n13":"oh","n14":["Se","i"],"n15":["ñor:","t"],"n16":"Tal","n17":["ban","i"],"n18":["que","m"],"n19":["te‿i","m"],"n20":["nes","m"],"n21":["ti","m"],"n22":["ma","m"],"n23":["ble,","t"],"n24":"Con","n25":["ban","i"],"n26":["de","m"],"n27":["ra","t"],"n28":"de","n29":["Tu‿a","i"],"n30":["mor.","t"],"n31":"¡Qué","n33":["mo","i"],"n34":["men","m"],"n35":["tos","t"],"n36":"en","n37":"Tu","n38":["me","i"],"n40":["sa!","t"],"n41":"Sin","n42":["te","i"],"n44":["mor","t"],"n45":"ni","n46":["du","i"],"n47":["da‿a","m"],"n48":["quí,","t"],"n49":["Dis","i"],"n50":["fru","m"],"n51":["tan","m"],"n52":["do","t"],"n53":"Tu","n54":["des","i"],"n55":["can","m"],"n56":["so,","t"],"n57":["O","i"],"n58":["cu","m"],"n59":["pa","m"],"n60":["dos","t"],"n61":["só","i"],"n62":["lo‿en","t"],"n63":"Ti."},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Nos gozamos en Tu mesa,","Guiados por Tu‿Espíritu,","Meditando‿en el recuerdo","De Tu sangre‿y su virtud.","Al tomar el pan y‿el vino","En memoria hoy de Ti,","Meditamos en Tu cuerpo","Y Tu sangre carmesí."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Oh, qué gozo‿es poder verte","En los símbolos, Señor:","El pan que nos fortalece","Y el vino‿alegrador.","Uno‿en Ti, nuestra Cabeza;","Congregados en amor;","Con el pan aquí tomamos","Tu bendita copa hoy."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Cuán real es Tu promesa:","\"Con vosotros estaré,","Al reunirse, congregados","En Mi nombre, cada vez\".","Más querida‿es la promesa","Para nuestro corazón,","Que‿estaremos para siempre","Donde Tú estés, Señor."]}]}